summary:
  Test clevis-pin-trustee with KBS on a confidential VM

description: |
  Sanity test for trustee on a confidential VM (AMD SEV-SNP).
  Tests clevis encrypt/decrypt round-trip with:
  - KBS in container (coco-as-builtin, insecure_key, allow_all.rego)
  - Real TEE attestation via trustee-attester (auto-detects SNP)
  - allow_all.rego policy to accept attestation evidence

  Works around missing AS/RVPS RPMs by using the container KBS
  image which has built-in attestation service support.

provision:
  hardware:
    virtualization:
      confidential: true

discover:
  how: fmf
  test:
    - /Functional/clevis-pin-trustee-basic-attestation

execute:
  how: tmt